OL,3,GNEWSAM8 Eastbound reopens after man
OL,4,Adies in bridge fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorway in Glasgow has reopened,
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a man who fell
OL,8,Fonto the carriageway from a bridge.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the incident
OL,11,Fhappened just before 03:00 on Sunday
OL,12,Fmorning at the M8 Junction 11, near the
OL,13,FCranhill area of the city.
OL,15,FThe eastbound carriageway remained
OL,16,Fclosed until Sunday afternoon while
OL,17,Fpolice investigated the 29-year-old's
OL,18,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
