OL,3,GNEWSAM8 Eastbound reopens after man
OL,4,Adies in bridge fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"Around 02:55 on Sunday 30 August,
OL,8,Fofficers attended the M8 at Cranhill,
OL,9,FGlasgow, following a report of a man
OL,10,Ffallen from a bridge onto the eastbound
OL,11,Fcarriageway.
